Return JSON code/report. Write ONLY imports and function feature_xml(feature, feature_id, sequence_length), at most 45 lines. feature is a Bio.SeqFeature.SeqFeature. Return ElementTree Element Feature with attrs id=str(feature_id), name=feature.qualifiers.get('label',[feature.type])[0], type=feature.type,directionality='2' if feature.location.strand==-1 else '1'. Require strand in (1,-1), location not None. Loop location.parts; require each part.strand same strand, both endpoints type ExactPosition (import from Bio.SeqFeature), 0<=start<end<=sequence_length else raise ValueError. Segment range is f'{int(part.start)+1}-{int(part.end)}', type standard,color #4CAF50. Reverse list(parts) for strand -1 before adding Segment nodes. Loop qualifiers items, normalize scalar to [scalar], create Q name=str(key), each V text=str(value) XML ATTRIBUTE (not element text). Include label qualifier. Use xml.etree.ElementTree. No other functions, no parser, no mocks, no CLI.
